@module leveldata ; The level phrases, the vector table, the edge fall, the maps, and the author's leftover text
@about The bytes between the code and the maps hold the IM 2 vector table, a routine the image keeps in the middle of the leftover text (FallOffEdge), and the text of the author's editor.

